Package: epiregion
Type: Package
Title: Regional DNA Methylation Analysis for Long-Read Sequencing Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Nisrine", "Hassini", email = "hassininisrine05@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides exploratory methods for regional DNA methylation
    analysis using long-read sequencing data. Includes methylation count
    simulation, regional aggregation, differential methylation testing,
    exploratory classification, and simulation-based benchmarking of
    site-level and region-level approaches. The current implementation is
    a research prototype evaluated using simulated data and has not been
    validated for clinical use.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: stats, glmnet, pROC
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), ggplot2
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
